--- /dev/null
+++ b/moldea/runtimes/eve.md
@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+# Eve runtime
+
+This project uses the nested `agent/` layout with Eve 0.39.1 and requires
+Node.js 24 or newer, as declared by `package.json`.
+
+The supported static boundary is path-sensitive. Always-on instructions use
+exact lowercase `instructions.md`, `instructions.ts`, or non-recursive entries
+under `instructions/`. Tools are module-backed files under `tools/`. Skills may
+use `skills/<name>.ts`, flat `skills/<name>.md`, or packaged
+`skills/<name>/SKILL.md` with the required description frontmatter. A local
+subagent uses `subagents/<id>/agent.ts`; a single-file `subagents/<id>.ts` is a
+remote-agent form and must export a supported remote definition. The support
+agent's structured output remains the schema assigned in `agent.ts`.
+
+Canonical static relationships do not by themselves prove runtime-resolved
+tools, remote deployments, mounted extension contributions, MCP or OpenAPI
+connection tools, framework-owned tools, or provider and model behavior. They
+also do not settle filesystem name collisions, extension-reserved namespaces,
+or advanced lifecycle, durability, replay, authorization, approval, and sandbox
+behavior. Require a supported static form or focused Eve build, discovery,
+integration, or runtime evidence before recording any of those surfaces.
